## 3. Quarterly-Sheet Workbooks & Sectoral Tables

Workbooks stored with separate quarterly tabs (consolidated via Power Query `Table.Combine`) and sectoral split tables used in Vision 2030 and graduate unemployment visuals.

| Arabic Filename / Table Name | English Translation | Sheet Structure | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `القطاعات.xlsx` | **Economic Sectors & Saudization** | Quarterly sheets | Distribution of workers and Saudization rates (`%`) across major economic activities (e.g., Wholesale & Retail, Construction, Education, Health). |
| `التوزيع النسبي للبطالة للحاصلين على دبلوم فأعلى` | **Unemployment Distribution by Academic Major (Diploma+)** | Quarterly sheets | Percentage share of unemployed graduates (Diploma and above) across academic fields (e.g., Business & Law, Education). |
| `معدل البطالة للحاصلين على دبلوم فأعلى` | **Unemployment Rate by Academic Major (Diploma+)** | Quarterly sheets | Unemployment rate (%) within each academic specialization for Diploma-and-above holders. |
| `قطاع خاص` | **Private Sector Employment** | Quarterly | Private-sector employment share (%) by nationality and gender, tracking Vision 2030 private-sector growth. |
| `قطاع عام` | **Public Sector Employment** | Quarterly | Public-sector employment share (%) by nationality and gender, used to measure the structural shift from public to private employment. |

